    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "08ad3affb937d797",
      "translationZh": "1. 如何在 Slipstream 上运行你现有的 V3 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b27c6ff7ecf0e273",
      "translationZh": "如果你已有上一篇文章中的模型（~/models/qwen38-flash-next-v3），可以直接让 Slipstream 使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "57623b56b7d21bd6",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：克隆并构建（不到 1 分钟）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5d6d0437814e811",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：下载模型（如果你还没有）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e310a0d9a9d8aade",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：提高 GPU 锁定内存上限并启动服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15988cd4b171ffc6",
      "translationZh": "首次运行说明：首次启动时，Slipstream 会检测多分片 GGUF 文件，并在 <model>/prepared/ 中准备优化后的流式数据包文件（约需 5–7 分钟）。后续启动的加载时间约为 10–15 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "609234ebf954521c",
      "translationZh": "该服务器提供标准的 OpenAI 兼容 API（http://127.0.0.1:8090/v1/chat/completions），可直接供 curl、Oh My Pi（omp）、Claude Code 或 OpenCode 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d665e483ba6f709",
      "translationZh": "2. 速度：llama.cpp 分支版与 Slipstream 对比（相同的 V3 检查点）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e094fb886754eb50",
      "translationZh": "下面是直接的正面对比：在同一台 M5 Pro（64 GB 统一内存，temperature 为 0.0）上，使用完全相同的 95.5 GiB 模型文件运行 6 项推理和编程任务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47e317fbe5580438",
      "translationZh": "领域 / 任务提示词 任务 llama.cpp 分支版 Slipstream 加速比 llama.cpp 首 token 延迟 Slipstream 首 token 延迟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bb79cea41784989",
      "translationZh": "MATH-500 级数（p - q）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "094e104ac5ca360b",
      "translationZh": "Slipstream 更快的原因：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "deefc99ef3606e9e",
      "translationZh": "异步提前层预取（fcntl(F_RDADVISE)）：在 llama.cpp 中，对于未命中的专家矩阵，同步页面读取会使 GPU 因 NVMe 延迟而停顿（每个数据块约 475 ms）。在 Slipstream 中，非阻塞预读提示会在 GPU 仍在执行上一层时，将即将使用的专家层从 SSD 流式加载到 RAM，从而将预填充阶段的数据准备延迟降低 28%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7aeee3ae3cfb3bc",
      "translationZh": "混合 MTP + Prompt Lookup 推测：在工具调用和代码生成期间，Prompt Lookup Decoding（PLD）以不到 50 ns 的耗时匹配提示词锚点，且内存分配次数为 0，从而避免草稿被拒绝。这将工具调用时的解码速度从 5.6 tok/s 提升至超过 45 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b51b7add36007bc4",
      "translationZh": "Metal GPU 映射的 n-gram 表：llama.cpp 在预填充期间访问 26.8 GiB 的 n-gram 表时发生故障。Slipstream 直接在 Metal 内核中映射并收集 n-gram 嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a0dee8ea331647dc",
      "translationZh": "3. 上下文扩展：高达 130,000 个 Token 的真实遥测数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad506908c45dcc79",
      "translationZh": "在标准 Transformer 中，随着上下文增长，解码速度会急剧下降，因为 KV 缓存不断膨胀，内存带宽趋于饱和。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcd365acff562f16",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 通过其混合架构避免了这一问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9d4bcfe70aaf96f",
      "translationZh": "48 个循环线性 DeltaNet 层（固定的 128 × 128 隐藏状态，内存随上下文增长的复杂度为 O(1)）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0efb624e5b66dde5",
      "translationZh": "仅 16 个全注意力层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db59bf42efb84276",
      "translationZh": "以下是在我的 M5 Pro（64 GB）上进行真实智能体编程会话期间，从 3,086 次实时请求中收集的实际遥测数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21da84b6e1483bf0",
      "translationZh": "上下文范围（Tokens） 实际运行次数 平均解码速度 解码速度中位数（p50） 峰值解码速度 平均 TTFT 备注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63d7fdc78992bdaa",
      "translationZh": "要点：上下文长度一直增加到 130k tokens，解码速度都保持在 33 到 44 tok/s 之间。即使在 130k 上下文下，它生成 token 的速度仍然比原版 llama.cpp 处理 500-token 提示词时更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
